.TH RAWHIDE 1
.SH NAME
rawhide \- cattle herding game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/rawhide
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I RawHide
is a cattle herding game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
The mouse or arrow keys move a horse used to drive cattle into the upper-left corral.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B mouse move
Move horse
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move horse
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/rawhide.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
